{"key":"map/gz3d1","relations":[{"id":"people","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/hwleader","title":"Hartweik","variant":""}],"title":"Inhabitants"},{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/merc10","title":"Aliya","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/glav","title":"Brother Khatul","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"inhabitant","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone3dun1%20sahilia%20f","title":"Alia (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone3dun1%20human%20palach1%20m","title":"Displeased executioner","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone3dun1%20rat1","title":"Grave rat","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone3dun1%20human%20fighter%20m","title":"Jailer","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone3dun1%20human%20palach0%20m","title":"Pleased executioner","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone3dun1%20human%20peasants%20m","title":"Prisoner","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone3dun1%20rat2","title":"Well-fed carrion eater","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"quest","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"quest/q13oh","title":"The Prison","variant":""}],"title":"Quests"},{"id":"exit","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz3h","title":"Necromancers' desert","variant":""}],"title":"Connected locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Prison</h1><p>This underground complex belongs to the necromancers' guild. It contains prison cells, a torture chamber, a courtroom and an execution chamber.</p><h2>Feiruz’s last rescue</h2><p>Feiruz asks Kir to repay his help by rescuing his imprisoned fiancée <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a>. He dies during the escape. Kel urges the grieving Aliya to avenge him and identifies the man who struck the fatal blow. Kir objects to deliberate revenge, but their companions insist on their code. The death of the prison commandant brings searches across the city. Fearing for his collection, Rindeil withdraws his protection, though he says Kir may return once the danger passes. Aliya then leads Kir and Kel to the Last Shelter and speaks for them before <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a>. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals, event scripts and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc8\">Feiruz</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_37)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_38)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a> (briefing brief_39)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/elder\">Rindeil</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a> (briefing brief_40)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/merc10\">Aliya</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/glav\">Brother Khatul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_41)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/suslanger\">Suslanger</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz3h\">Necromancers' desert</a></td></tr></table><h2>Quests</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Quests</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q13oh\">The Prison</a></td></tr></table><h2>Inhabitants</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hwleader\">Hartweik</a></td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-colum